        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Gordon Green, Larry Hagman\n- Roles: filmmaker, actor, director, producer\n- Works: Dallas, I Dream of Jeannie\n\nFacts:\n- David Gordon Green was born on April 9, 1975, and is an American filmmaker.\n- Larry Martin Hagman was born on September 21, 1931, and was an American film and television actor, director, and producer.\n- Larry Hagman was best known for playing J.R. Ewing, a ruthless oil baron, in the 1980s primetime television soap opera Dallas.\n- Larry Hagman was also best known for playing astronaut Major Anthony \"Tony\" Nelson in the 1960s sitcom I Dream of Jeannie.\n- Larry Hagman died on November 23, 2012.",
